# Note on data and outputs: data/ and outputs/ ARE tracked on purpose, so the
# project is reproducible without re-downloading ~200 MB. Everything under them
# is regenerable by running src/01 .. src/17 in order - see README.

# The raw Overpass building dump is 122 MB and is NOT read by the pipeline at
# run time - src/04 parses it once into data/processed/osm_building_pts.npy
# (3.5 MB, tracked), and everything downstream uses that. It is excluded because
# a 122 MB Git LFS object could not be uploaded over this connection, and
# `python src/01_fetch_nonsatellite.py` re-downloads it in ~5 minutes.
data/raw/osm_buildings.json
